    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "Math feels like both a bridge and a barrier for me—useful when working through logic in computer science but intimidating due to abstract concepts beyond my current education level. I try not to stress too much; it’s a skill that can be built with patience, especially since I’m still in upper secondary school.",
