    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "Not yet, but I imagine tools like Khan Academy’s AI tutors could help break down concepts gently. With my low openness (score: 23), interactive platforms might feel less intimidating than textbooks or lectures—though I’d avoid over-reliance to keep learning active.",
